---
name: design-document
version: 1.0.0
description: Render a design document.
required_variables: [record]
optional_variables: [summary]
defaults: {summary: ""}
---
# {{ record.title }}

**Status:** {{ record.status }}
**Owner:** {{ record.document_metadata.owner }}

{% set body = record.content.markdown %}
{% set sections = ["Executive Summary", "Requirements Traceability", "Architecture References", "Core Data Structures", "Algorithm Specification", "Cache Architecture", "Implementation Details", "Unit Test Design", "Benchmark Design", "Performance Characteristics", "Integration Points", "Cross-References", "Implementation Checklist", "Related Documents"] %}
{% if "## " in body %}{{ body }}

{% endif %}{% for section in sections %}{% if ("## " ~ section) not in body %}## {{ section }}

{% if "## " not in body and section == "Executive Summary" %}{{ body }}

{% endif %}{% endif %}{% endfor %}
